                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tanaafi nami toko goli teenna tahu male, aka inni kaisa Aabbo Yeso nu woliini d'ugeesu, nami suni nama bara nu Aabbo woliini teenne nu woliini jiru tahu male, haga Yohana nama batisutifi haga Yesoni nu bira gubbati olgale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.21+ACT.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.21",
              "ACT.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba worri nama lama maqa d'ae; toko Yusufu, ka Barsaba jed'ani, ka maqaani lameeso Yusto; ka lameeso Mathiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani Waaqa kad'atani waan jed'ani, Aabbo, atini garaa nama ch'ufa imbeeta. Nama atini fohatte, jara lamaani kana keesa nu garsiisi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka inni huji tana keesa qooda argate ergattu tahu ta Yudani lakise fulla isaa malte biraa deeme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani hit'a buusani, hit'aani Mathiya ira bue, inni ergattu kud'ani tokoti darame.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
